DexSwapModule_EncodeDecodeParams
├── given valid params
│   └── it should round-trip all fields correctly
├── given params with a non-zero maxAmount
│   └── it should round-trip the maxAmount
├── given zero address target token
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given max-value params
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given encoded length
│   └── it should be 256 bytes (8 ABI words)
└── fuzz
    └── it should round-trip any params correctly
